# Good Skills 项目配置

Good Skills 是 AI 助手技能集合，支持 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、OpenCode 等平台。

## 技能类别
- AI/ML: models-test, vllm-dev-workflow, vllm-ascend-profiler-diff, monkey-patch
- 开发工具: dev-workflow, brainstorming, writing-plans, skill-creator, find-skills
- Git 工作流: git-commit, github-pr-creation, github-pr-review, github-pr-merge
- 文档: docx, pptx, pdf, xlsx
- 知识管理: archive-conversation, remembering-conversations, session-logger
- Web 自动化: agent-browser, browser-use, clawdirect-dev
- 前端最佳实践: next-best-practices, vercel-react-best-practices
- 其他: copywriting, research, patent-search, patent-specialist

## Git 提交规范
使用 Conventional Commits: `type(scope): subject`
- 类型: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, security
- scope 必须（kebab-case）
- subject 不超过 50 字符

## 安装
./install.sh --all --claude --opencode --github-copilot
